OL,3,GNEWSANHS doctor launches women-only car
OL,4,Aworkshops
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS doctor and car lover said she is
OL,7,Fon a mission to empower women to become
OL,8,Fmore car literate so they can fix their
OL,9,Fown vehicle problems if they get into
OL,10,Fvulnerable situations.
OL,12,FLouise Willcott, 31, said her love of
OL,13,Fmotors had made her into the go-to
OL,14,Fperson for a lot of her friends when
OL,15,Fthey had car problems.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
