OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANHS doctor launches women-only car
OL,4,Aworkshops
OL,5,
OL,6,FWillcott launched The Women's Auto
OL,7,FAcademy three months ago and runs
OL,8,Fwomen-only workshops in Potters Bar,
OL,9,FHertfordshire and Macclesfield to teach
OL,10,Fthem key skills such as how to change a
OL,11,Fflat tyre, check for oil and jumpstart
OL,12,Fa car.
OL,14,FShe said: "It's kind of ingrained into
OL,15,Fsociety that you need to call a man for
OL,16,Fhelp or go to see this mechanic-man.
OL,17,FThat's crazy to me."
